cue0032165
01:08:14.960 --> 01:08:17.060
by telling them things that

cue0032166
01:08:17.060 --> 01:08:19.520
you never knew and I'm sure they never knew

cue0032167
01:08:19.520 --> 01:08:22.280
on Friday

cue0032168
01:08:22.280 --> 01:08:24.420
April 15th

cue0032169
01:08:24.420 --> 01:08:26.220
we will have a luncheon lecture

cue0032170
01:08:26.220 --> 01:08:28.820
in which here at the college

cue0032171
01:08:28.820 --> 01:08:29.500
that's a Friday

cue0032172
01:08:29.500 --> 01:08:32.320
on which Professor Faor will speak about

cue0032173
